      {
       "t": "heading",
       "level": "h1",
       "html": "About Us",
       "text": "About Us"
      },
      {
       "t": "text",
       "html": "<p><img data-ref=\"https://www.liftedshopdc.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/9fa5cf_5493e80ccfd34883bac668e80a804095_mv2-e1664312318345-1024x647.jpg-e1745338932965.webp\" alt=\"\">Lifted Shop DC is the best place in Washington, DC, to buy weed. We have a large selection of high-quality cannabis, and we have knowledgeable staff who can help you find what’s suitable for your needs.</p>"
      },
      {
       "t": "heading",
       "level": "h2",
       "html": "Our Delivery Areas",
       "text": "Our Delivery Areas"
      },
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "3d1a0c1",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<ul><li>Delivery Available up to 100 Miles!</li><li><a href=\"/delivery/\">Delivery</a> throughout Maryland, Virginia, and Northern Virginia FREE!</li><li>Biggest Selection!</li></ul>"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "0ac206a",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": "h2",
         "html": "LOCATION",
         "text": "LOCATION"
        },
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>Address: Washington, D.C.<br>Phone: <a href=\"tel:7712161684\">(771) 216-1684</a></p>"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "1fbdc9b",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": "h2",
         "html": "FAQ",
         "text": "FAQ"
        },
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>Please read all of our FAQ’s before calling – your question may already be answered above. <a href=\"tel:7712161684\">(771) 216-1684</a></p>"
        },
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": "h3",
         "html": "What are your hours of operation​",
         "text": "What are your hours of operation​"
        },
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>We’re open 10AM – 9PM EVERYDAY.</p>"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "c9aaf3e",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": "h3",
         "html": "Does it matter if I’m from a different city or state",
         "text": "Does it matter if I’m from a different city or state"
        },
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>No, It does not matter where you’re from. We are recreational and weed is legal in DC.</p>"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "1e1eff2",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": "h3",
         "html": "Is there a limit on how many gifts i can receive",
         "text": "Is there a limit on how many gifts i can receive"
        },
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>Nope! Get as much as your high heart desires.</p>"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "7a87525",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": "h3",
         "html": "Do I need to have my medical card when visiting",
         "text": "Do I need to have my medical card when visiting"
        },
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>Nope – Recreational means no medical card needed when visiting our shop</p>"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "11be1ea",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": "h3",
         "html": "Where are you located",
         "text": "Where are you located"
        },
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p><a href=\"/contact/\">The Lifted Shop</a> is located at Washington, D.C. – At Listen Vision Studios, right upstairs!</p>"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "8d17b2a",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": "h3",
         "html": "Is there an age limit",
         "text": "Is there an age limit"
        },
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>Yes! All customers must be 21+</p>"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "d87688f",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": "h3",
         "html": "Do you offer delivery as well",
         "text": "Do you offer delivery as well"
        },
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>Of course we do silly! Head over to our delivery tab for more information on weed delivery.</p>"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "group",
       "id": "87e8b06",
       "children": [
        {
         "t": "heading",
         "level": "h3",
         "html": "Where do you deliver",
         "text": "Where do you deliver"
        },
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>We deliver to Washington D.C., Maryland &amp; Virginia. However – Maryland &amp; Virginia have a radius limit of 30 miles, as well as a minimal payment limit of $300 – which is explained in full detail on our delivery menu tab.</p>"
        },
        {
         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>*Results May Vary</p>"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
